{"title":"资本家的利润(木刻组画·四川作品)","authors":["李少言","李焕民"],"dates":[{"year":1965,"month":6,"day":4}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"解放前，资本家利用欺骗手段来剥削工人的无偿劳动。为了把一批钢材从码头运到工厂，竟以招工为名，要前来考试的工人搬运钢材，等把钢材运完，考试也结束了，结果全都不要。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一、大批钢材运到"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二、贴出招工布告"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三、失业工人应考"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四、为了一家老少"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"五、搬运过重晕倒"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"六、老板暗暗微笑"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七、钢材运到工厂"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"八、结果全都不要"}],"comments":[],"origin":"","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}